[{"i":"10282","no":1,"t":2,"s":"<p>关于齿轮传动的特点说法正确的有？（　）</p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p>能够精确地计算传动比</p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p>能够有缓冲作用保护机械</p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p>适合近距离传动</p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p>适合远距离传动</p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"10303","no":2,"t":2,"s":"<p>关于齿轮啮合下列说法正确的有？（　）</p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p>主动轮大于从动轮起加速作用</p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p>主动轮大于从动轮起减速作用</p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p>平行啮合的两轮转向相反</p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p>平行啮合的两轮转向相同</p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"10304","no":3,"t":2,"s":"<p>在搭建奇怪的时钟模型时，下列说法正确的是？（　）</p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p>时针和分针不可能固定在同轴齿轮上</p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p>固定时针和分针的齿轮有可能是同轴齿轮</p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p>模型一定会采用冠齿轮</p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p>固定时针和分针时要注意选择合适的长度以免在旋转过程中被其他零件卡住</p>"}],"a":"A,D","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮和齿轮比的概念","不同种类的齿轮"]},{"i":"10305","no":4,"t":2,"s":"<p>关于模型中的手摇把手说法正确的是？（　）</p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p>手柄越长越省力</p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p>相当于费力杠杆</p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p>相当于省力杠杆</p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p>相当于等臂杠杆</p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["省力杠杆和费力杠杆","六种简单机械原理（杠杆，轮轴，滑轮，斜面，楔，螺旋）"]},{"i":"10306","no":5,"t":4,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">实际操作</font><font face=\"Calibri\">(</font><font face=\"宋体\">共</font><font face=\"Calibri\">1</font><font face=\"宋体\">题，共</font><font face=\"Calibri\">80</font><font face=\"宋体\">分</font><font face=\"Calibri\">)</font></span></b><b><span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>5.</span><span>搭建说明</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>请考生制作一个奇怪的时钟模型。</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>搭建要求</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(a) </font><font face=\"宋体\">具备奇怪的时钟模型大体框架；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(b) </font><font face=\"宋体\">具备多级齿轮传动，具备同轴齿轮；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(c) </font><font face=\"宋体\">具备手摇把手，具备用于表示时针分针的部件；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(d) </font><font face=\"宋体\">缓慢旋转手摇把手，两个针旋转，且转向相同，转速不同；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(e) </font><font face=\"宋体\">整体动作流畅。</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>器材说明</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>考生作答时不指定任何器材，所搭建的模型在外形、结构、功能方面满足题目要求即可。以下样例模型选自经中国电子学会评审通过的青少年机器人技术等级考试一级、二级适用器材。仅供参考，不作为考试评分的唯一依据。</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>案例样图</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>以下列举了相关器材模型样例，考生可任选其一作为参考。</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">1</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-21-36/8489856331778580480.png\" alt=\"undefined\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">2</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-21-36/8489856331925381120.png\" alt=\"undefined\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">3</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-21-36/8489856332063793152.png\" alt=\"undefined\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">4</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-21-36/8489856332202205184.png\" alt=\"undefined\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">5</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-21-36/8489856332294479872.png\" alt=\"undefined\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">6</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-15-21-36/8489856332428697600.png\" alt=\"undefined\"></span></p>","o":[],"a":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>评分</span></b><b><span>说明</span></b><b><span>(共</span></b><b><span>80</span></b><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">分</font><font face=\"宋体\">)</font></span></b><b><span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>1、</span></b><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">整体框架（</font>40分）</span></b><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>1)作品零件结构是否和样例模型基本一致、结构完整</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">，具备</font><font face=\"宋体\">①奇怪的</font></span><span>时钟大体框架</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">、</font><font face=\"宋体\">②同轴齿轮、③时针和</font></span><span>分针（</span><span>缺一不可</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">）、</font><font face=\"宋体\">④手摇把手</font></span><span>，以上每缺少一点扣</span><span>10</span><span>分，缺少两点及两点以上扣</span><span>20</span><span>分。（</span><span>20</span><span>分）</span><span><br></span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>(</span><span>2)作品相应部件的固定可靠程度</span><span>；</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>10分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>3)作品的整体协调性和美观性。（10分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>2、</span></b><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">动力传递</font>/表现形式（30分）</span></b><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>1)缓慢旋转手摇把手，两个针旋转，且转向相同，转速不同</span><span>；</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>15分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>2)作品整体动作顺利流畅。（15分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>3、</span></b><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">完成时间（</font>10分）</span></b><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>在考试时间内完成得</span><span>10</span><span>分，超时</span><span>1</span><span>分钟扣</span><span>1</span><span>分。（</span><span>10</span><span>分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>超时</span><span>10</span><span>分钟以上不结束操作总成绩记为</span><span>0</span><span>分。</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>","an":"","sc":80.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念","动滑轮、定滑轮的特点","六种简单机械原理（杠杆，轮轴，滑轮，斜面，楔，螺旋）"]}]